flowchart TB
  accTitle: A generic multimodal interface with separate image and text paths
  accDescr: Text tokens go through embeddings. Image input goes through a vision encoder and projector or adapter. The representations join the model's input stream under its documented assembly convention, then enter the language model. This is not a named model's exact implementation.
  I["Image input"] --> V["Vision encoder → features"]
  V --> P["Projection / adapter"]
  T["Text token IDs"] --> E["Text embeddings"]
  P --> S["Assemble LM inputs"]
  E --> S
  S --> L["Language model"]
